  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-3-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las funciones \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=e^{x-1}\\) y \\(g(x)=e^{1-x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y de \\(g\\) y determina su punto de corte.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por el eje \\(OY\\) y las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es la exponencial \\(e^x\\) trasladada una unidad a la derecha (creciente, pasa por \\((1,1)\\)); \\(g(x)=f(2-x)\\) es su simétrica respecto de la recta \\(x=1\\) (decreciente).</p>\\[e^{x-1}=e^{1-x}\\iff x-1=1-x\\iff x=1\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='98.0,52.3 99.6,55.5 101.2,58.6 102.9,61.6 104.5,64.5 106.1,67.4 107.7,70.2 109.4,73.0 111.0,75.6 112.6,78.2 114.2,80.8 115.9,83.2 117.5,85.7 119.1,88.0 120.7,90.3 122.4,92.6 124.0,94.7 125.6,96.9 127.2,99.0 128.9,101.0 130.5,103.0 132.1,104.9 133.8,106.8 135.4,108.6 137.0,110.4 138.6,112.1 140.2,113.8 141.9,115.5 143.5,117.1 145.1,118.7 146.8,120.2 148.4,121.7 150.0,123.2 151.6,124.6 153.2,126.0 154.9,127.4 156.5,128.7 158.1,130.0 159.8,131.3 161.4,132.5 163.0,133.7 163.0,133.7 161.4,134.9 159.8,136.0 158.1,137.1 156.5,138.2 154.9,139.3 153.2,140.3 151.6,141.3 150.0,142.3 148.4,143.2 146.8,144.2 145.1,145.1 143.5,146.0 141.9,146.8 140.2,147.7 138.6,148.5 137.0,149.3 135.4,150.1 133.8,150.8 132.1,151.6 130.5,152.3 128.9,153.0 127.2,153.7 125.6,154.4 124.0,155.1 122.4,155.7 120.7,156.3 119.1,156.9 117.5,157.5 115.9,158.1 114.2,158.7 112.6,159.2 111.0,159.8 109.4,160.3 107.7,160.8 106.1,161.3 104.5,161.8 102.9,162.3 101.2,162.7 99.6,163.2 98.0,163.6' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,175.8 22.8,175.6 25.5,175.3 28.3,175.1 31.0,174.8 33.8,174.6 36.6,174.3 39.3,174.0 42.1,173.7 44.9,173.4 47.6,173.0 50.4,172.7 53.1,172.3 55.9,171.9 58.7,171.5 61.4,171.1 64.2,170.7 67.0,170.2 69.7,169.8 72.5,169.3 75.2,168.8 78.0,168.2 80.8,167.7 83.5,167.1 86.3,166.5 89.1,165.9 91.8,165.2 94.6,164.5 97.4,163.8 100.1,163.1 102.9,162.3 105.6,161.5 108.4,160.6 111.2,159.7 113.9,158.8 116.7,157.8 119.5,156.8 122.2,155.8 125.0,154.7 127.7,153.5 130.5,152.3 133.3,151.1 136.0,149.8 138.8,148.4 141.6,147.0 144.3,145.5 147.1,144.0 149.8,142.4 152.6,140.7 155.4,138.9 158.1,137.1 160.9,135.2 163.7,133.2 166.4,131.1 169.2,129.0 171.9,126.7 174.7,124.3 177.5,121.9 180.2,119.3 183.0,116.6 185.8,113.8 188.5,110.9 191.3,107.9 194.0,104.7 196.8,101.4 199.6,97.9 202.3,94.3 205.1,90.5 207.8,86.6 210.6,82.5 213.4,78.2 216.1,73.8 218.9,69.1 221.7,64.3 224.4,59.2 227.2,53.9 230.0,48.4 232.7,42.6 235.5,36.6 238.2,30.3 241.0,23.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='85.0,23.8 87.4,29.6 89.9,35.1 92.3,40.5 94.8,45.7 97.2,50.7 99.6,55.5 102.1,60.1 104.5,64.5 106.9,68.8 109.4,73.0 111.8,76.9 114.2,80.8 116.7,84.5 119.1,88.0 121.6,91.4 124.0,94.7 126.4,97.9 128.9,101.0 131.3,103.9 133.8,106.8 136.2,109.5 138.6,112.1 141.1,114.7 143.5,117.1 145.9,119.5 148.4,121.7 150.8,123.9 153.2,126.0 155.7,128.0 158.1,130.0 160.6,131.9 163.0,133.7 165.4,135.4 167.9,137.1 170.3,138.7 172.8,140.3 175.2,141.8 177.6,143.2 180.1,144.6 182.5,146.0 184.9,147.3 187.4,148.5 189.8,149.7 192.2,150.8 194.7,152.0 197.1,153.0 199.6,154.1 202.0,155.1 204.4,156.0 206.9,156.9 209.3,157.8 211.8,158.7 214.2,159.5 216.6,160.3 219.1,161.1 221.5,161.8 223.9,162.5 226.4,163.2 228.8,163.8 231.2,164.5 233.7,165.1 236.1,165.7 238.6,166.2 241.0,166.8 243.4,167.3 245.9,167.8 248.3,168.3 250.8,168.8 253.2,169.2 255.6,169.7 258.1,170.1 260.5,170.5 262.9,170.9 265.4,171.2 267.8,171.6 270.2,172.0 272.7,172.3 275.1,172.6 277.6,172.9 280.0,173.2' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='163.0' cy='133.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='155.0' y='149.7'>(1,1)</text><circle cx='98.0' cy='52.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='84.0' y='52.3'>e</text><circle cx='98.0' cy='163.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='72.0' y='169.6'>1/e</text><text x='228.0' y='41.3' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='107.7' y='31.8' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>g</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 181.1H294.0M98.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='163.0' y1='178.1' x2='163.0' y2='184.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='160.0' y='195.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='228.0' y1='178.1' x2='228.0' y2='184.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='225.0' y='195.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='95.0' y1='133.7' x2='101.0' y2='133.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='137.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='95.0' y1='86.3' x2='101.0' y2='86.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='90.3' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((1,1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El recinto va de \\(x=0\\) (eje \\(OY\\)) a \\(x=1\\), con \\(g\\) por encima:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^1\\bigl(e^{1-x}-e^{x-1}\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[-e^{1-x}-e^{x-1}\\Bigr]_0^1=(-1-1)-\\left(-e-\\frac1e\\right)=e+\\frac1e-2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=e+\\dfrac1e-2\\approx1{,}086\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-3-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha&1\\\\2&3\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\-1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina los valores de \\(\\alpha\\) para los que la matriz \\(A\\) tiene inversa.",
     "(1,75 p.) Para \\(\\alpha=1\\), calcula \\(A^{-1}\\) y resuelve la ecuación matricial \\(AX=B\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\alpha&1\\\\2&3\\end{vmatrix}=3\\alpha-2=0\\iff\\alpha=\\frac23\\]<div class='res'>\\(A\\) tiene inversa si y solo si \\(\\alpha\\neq\\dfrac23\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\alpha=1\\), \\(|A|=1\\):</p>\\[A^{-1}=\\frac1{|A|}\\operatorname{Adj}(A)^t=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>\\(AX=B\\iff X=A^{-1}B\\):</p>\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 0\\\\-1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}7 & -1\\\\-5 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}7 & -1\\\\-5 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-3-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(r\\) la recta definida por \\(\\dfrac{x-2}3=\\dfrac{y-k}4=\\dfrac z5\\) y \\(s\\) la recta definida por \\(\\dfrac{x+2}{-1}=\\dfrac{y-1}2=\\dfrac{z-3}3\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Halla \\(k\\) sabiendo que las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cortan en un punto.",
     "(1,25 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(2,k,0)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(3,4,5)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(-2,1,3)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(-1,2,3)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales, así que las rectas se cortan o se cruzan. Se cortan si y solo si \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-4,\\,1-k,\\,3)\\), \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\) son coplanarios. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}-4&1-k&3\\\\3&4&5\\\\-1&2&3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-48+5 k - 5+18\\bigr)-\\bigl(-12-40+9 - 9 k\\bigr)\\]\\[=14k+8\\]<p>\\(14k+8=0\\iff k=-\\frac47\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(k=-\\dfrac47\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a las dos rectas: su normal es perpendicular a \\(\\vec u\\) y a \\(\\vec v\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\3&4&5\\\\-1&2&3\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,-14,\\,10)\\parallel(1,-7,5)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x-7y+5z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(S(-2,1,3)\\): \\(-2-7+15+D=0\\iff D=-6\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-81,\"el\":34,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2.427,2.099,3.653],[-2.857,1.344,3.653],[-2.105,-3.92,-3.867],[3.179,-3.166,-3.867]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-2.105,-3.92,-3.867],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-1.9,-5.771,-6.5],[3.5,1.429,2.5],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.5,1.429,2.5],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.9,-4.8,-5.7],[-2.4,1.8,4.2],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-2.4,1.8,4.2],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"pt\",[0.071,-3.143,-3.214],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r3a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r3a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r3a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r3a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='121.8,30.4 28.9,29.6 27.5,189.9 120.4,190.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='31.5' y='189.9' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='26.0' y1='246.0' x2='138.5' y2='55.1' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='144.5' y='55.1' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='76.8' y1='229.4' x2='38.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='44.0' y='18.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='67.1' cy='176.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.1' y='170.3' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.8' y2='271.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.3' y='275.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='26.5' y2='261.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='24.4' y='262.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='256.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='256.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x-7y+5z-6=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(R\\left(2,-\\frac47,0\\right)\\): \\(2+4+0-6=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
