  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-3-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x(x-3)^2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Haz un esbozo de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y el eje de abscisas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es un polinomio, derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\). Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=(x-3)^2+2x(x-3)=(x-3)(3x-3)=3(x-1)(x-3)=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1},\\ \\boxed{x=3}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(4) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\) y \\((3,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((1,3)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\cup(3,+\\infty)\\); decrece en \\((1,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Máximo en \\((1,4)\\), mínimo en \\((3,0)\\); corta al eje en \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=3\\) (raíz doble, donde es tangente).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='60.0,150.8 63.7,134.0 67.5,118.9 71.2,105.5 75.0,93.6 78.8,83.2 82.5,74.2 86.3,66.7 90.0,60.4 93.8,55.3 97.5,51.5 101.2,48.7 105.0,47.0 108.7,46.2 112.5,46.3 116.2,47.3 120.0,49.1 123.8,51.5 127.5,54.6 131.2,58.3 135.0,62.5 138.8,67.1 142.5,72.1 146.2,77.4 150.0,83.0 153.8,88.7 157.5,94.5 161.3,100.4 165.0,106.3 168.8,112.1 172.5,117.7 176.2,123.1 180.0,128.2 183.8,132.9 187.5,137.3 191.2,141.1 195.0,144.4 198.8,147.1 202.5,149.1 206.2,150.3 210.0,150.8 210.0,150.8 206.2,150.8 202.5,150.8 198.8,150.8 195.0,150.8 191.2,150.8 187.5,150.8 183.8,150.8 180.0,150.8 176.2,150.8 172.5,150.8 168.8,150.8 165.0,150.8 161.3,150.8 157.5,150.8 153.8,150.8 150.0,150.8 146.2,150.8 142.5,150.8 138.8,150.8 135.0,150.8 131.2,150.8 127.5,150.8 123.8,150.8 120.0,150.8 116.2,150.8 112.5,150.8 108.7,150.8 105.0,150.8 101.2,150.8 97.5,150.8 93.8,150.8 90.0,150.8 86.3,150.8 82.5,150.8 78.8,150.8 75.0,150.8 71.2,150.8 67.5,150.8 63.7,150.8 60.0,150.8' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='45.0,236.2 47.2,221.4 49.5,207.4 51.8,194.0 54.0,181.3 56.2,169.3 58.5,158.0 60.8,147.3 63.0,137.2 65.2,127.8 67.5,118.9 69.8,110.6 72.0,103.0 74.2,95.8 76.5,89.2 78.8,83.2 81.0,77.7 83.2,72.6 85.5,68.1 87.7,64.0 90.0,60.4 92.2,57.2 94.5,54.5 96.7,52.2 99.0,50.2 101.2,48.7 103.5,47.5 105.8,46.7 108.0,46.3 110.2,46.2 112.5,46.3 114.8,46.8 117.0,47.6 119.3,48.7 121.5,50.0 123.8,51.5 126.0,53.3 128.2,55.3 130.5,57.5 132.8,59.9 135.0,62.5 137.2,65.2 139.5,68.1 141.8,71.1 144.0,74.2 146.2,77.4 148.5,80.7 150.8,84.1 153.0,87.5 155.2,91.0 157.5,94.5 159.8,98.1 162.0,101.6 164.2,105.1 166.5,108.6 168.8,112.1 171.0,115.4 173.2,118.8 175.5,122.0 177.8,125.1 180.0,128.2 182.2,131.1 184.5,133.8 186.7,136.4 189.0,138.9 191.2,141.1 193.5,143.2 195.8,145.0 198.0,146.6 200.3,148.0 202.5,149.1 204.8,149.9 207.0,150.5 209.2,150.8 211.5,150.7 213.8,150.3 216.0,149.6 218.2,148.5 220.5,147.1 222.8,145.2 225.0,143.0 227.2,140.4 229.5,137.3 231.8,133.8 234.0,129.8 236.2,125.4 238.5,120.4 240.8,115.0 243.0,109.1 245.2,102.6 247.5,95.6 249.8,88.0 252.0,79.9 254.2,71.2 256.5,61.9 258.8,51.9 261.0,41.4 263.2,30.2 265.5,18.3 267.8,5.8 270.0,-7.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='110.0' cy='46.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='116.0' y='40.2'>(1,4)</text><circle cx='210.0' cy='150.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='214.0' y='166.8'>(3,0)</text><circle cx='60.0' cy='150.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='26.0' y='146.8'>(0,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 150.8H294.0M60.0 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='110.0' y1='147.8' x2='110.0' y2='153.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='107.0' y='164.8' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='160.0' y1='147.8' x2='160.0' y2='153.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='164.8' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='210.0' y1='147.8' x2='210.0' y2='153.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.0' y='164.8' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='260.0' y1='147.8' x2='260.0' y2='153.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='257.0' y='164.8' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='57.0' y1='98.5' x2='63.0' y2='98.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='102.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='57.0' y1='46.2' x2='63.0' y2='46.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='50.2' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre 0 y 3, \\(f\\geq0\\):</p>\\[A=\\int_0^3(x^3-6x^2+9x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^4}4-2x^3+\\frac{9x^2}2\\Bigr]_0^3=\\frac{81}4-54+\\frac{81}2=\\frac{27}4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
