  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-3-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+y+z=0\\\\2x+\\lambda y+z=2\\\\x+y+\\lambda z=\\lambda-1\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina el valor de \\(\\lambda\\) para que el sistema sea incompatible.",
     "(1 p.) Resuelve el sistema para \\(\\lambda=1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&1&1&0\\\\2&\\lambda&1&2\\\\1&1&\\lambda&\\lambda-1\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1\\\\2&\\lambda&1\\\\1&1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\lambda^{2}+1+2\\bigr)-\\bigl(\\lambda+1+2 \\lambda\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^2-3\\lambda+2=(\\lambda-1)(\\lambda-2)\\]<p>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq1,2\\): compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• </b>\\(\\lambda=2\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\) (columnas 1 y 3): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 3 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&0\\\\2&1&2\\\\1&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+2+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+4+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=-3\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\): incompatible.</p><p><b>• </b>\\(\\lambda=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&1&1&0\\\\2&1&1&2\\\\1&1&1&0\\end{array}\\right)\\): la 3.ª fila es igual a la 1.ª y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\). \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\): compatible indeterminado.</p><div class='res'>El sistema es incompatible para \\(\\lambda=2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=1\\): \\(x+y+z=0\\), \\(2x+y+z=2\\). Restando, \\(x=2\\); con \\(z=t\\), \\(y=-2-t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=2,\\ y=-2-t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
