   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla la ecuación de la recta contenida en el plano de ecuación \\(x+2y+3z-1=0\\) que corta perpendicularmente a la recta definida por \\(\\begin{cases}x=2z+4\\\\y=2z+3\\end{cases}\\) en el punto \\((2,1,-1)\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta dada, con \\(z=t\\), es \\(s\\equiv(4+2t,\\ 3+2t,\\ t)\\), con director \\(\\vec u=(2,2,1)\\). El punto \\(P(2,1,-1)\\) está en \\(s\\) (\\(t=-1\\)) y en el plano (\\(2+2-3-1=0\\)).</p><p>La recta buscada pasa por \\(P\\), es perpendicular a \\(s\\) (director \\(\\perp\\vec u\\)) y está en el plano (director \\(\\perp\\vec n=(1,2,3)\\)):</p>\\[\\vec d=\\vec u\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&2&1\\\\1&2&3\\end{vmatrix}=(4,\\,-5,\\,2)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":111,\"el\":68,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-6.306,1.105,1.699],[7.068,-5.582,1.699],[10.306,0.895,-3.699],[-3.068,7.582,-3.699]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[10.306,0.895,-3.699],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-2.8,-3.8,-3.4],[3.6,2.6,-0.2],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,2.6,-0.2],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"line\",[-2.0,6.0,-3.0],[6.0,-4.0,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[6.0,-4.0,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[2.333,1.333,-0.833],[2.631,0.961,-0.684],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.631,0.961,-0.684],[2.298,0.627,-0.851],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[2,1,-1],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r3b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r3b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r3b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r3b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker>